Fixed `nautobot_ssot_duration_seconds` dropping the whole days from any phase that ran for a day or longer, and reporting `source_load_time` on a different scale from the other phases.
Fixed the per-status counts in the sync count gauge always reporting zero.
Fixed `nautobot_ssot_sync_memory_usage_bytes` reporting a sync's create, update and delete counts in place of the memory it used in bytes.
Fixed memory profiling with parallel loading discarding the memory used to load the adapters, which also left those syncs out of `nautobot_ssot_sync_memory_usage_bytes`.
Fixed memory profiling leaving memory tracing running in the worker after the job finished, which slowed every job that worker ran afterwards.
Fixed a running Sync reporting no duration.
